<div id="article_show_text">We have just released RawTherapee 5.1-rc1.&nbsp;This is a release candidate for version 5.1. This is not version 5.1 yet. This release is meant for testing in order to enable us to release a stable 5.1.<div><a name="lead_end"></a><br></div><div>Downloads available&nbsp;<a href="https://discuss.pixls.us/t/rawtherapee-5-1-rc1-released/4146?u=morgan_hardwood" target="_blank" title="">from our forum</a>.</div><div><br></div><div>If you run into any issues, file a proper bug report as explained in&nbsp;<a href="http://rawpedia.rawtherapee.com/How_to_write_useful_bug_reports" target="_blank" title="">RawPedia</a>.</div><div><br></div><div>Package maintainers can get the code by checking out the "<a href="https://github.com/Beep6581/RawTherapee/releases/tag/5.1-rc1" target="_blank" title="">5.1-rc1</a>" tag in git, or by downloading a no-git-required tarball from&nbsp;<a href="http://rawtherapee.com/shared/source/" target="_blank" title="">here</a>.<br></div><div><br></div><div>A full list of new features will be made available once 5.1 is released. If no issues are found with this release candidate, the final release will be made in about 5 days time.</div></div>

